{"id":"38350e32be23e7a3","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-grz-frame.md","title":"Finite Grz Frame","display":"df-grz-frame — Finite Grz Frame","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-grz-frame","aliases":["89-df-grz-frame"],"display":"df-grz-frame — Finite Grz Frame","depends_on":["[[89-df-kripke-frame]]","[[89-df-finite]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-grz-frame"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-grz-frame</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-grz-frame — Finite Grz Frame"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9cd755e57aea2c47\" href=\"?note=9cd755e57aea2c47\" title=\"89-df-finite\">89-df-finite</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(W,R)\">\\(F=(W,R)\\)</span> 为非空框架。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\\)</span> 表示存在有限序数到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 的双射；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GrzFin}(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{GrzFin}(F)\\)</span> 是下述定义的有限偏序框架谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}grz\\text{-}frame}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GrzFin}(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\\land\n\\forall w\\in W\\ wRw\\land\n\\forall w,x,y\\in W\\ ((wRx\\land xRy)\\to wRy)\\land\n\\forall w,x\\in W\\ ((wRx\\land xRw)\\to w=x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}grz\\text{-}frame}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GrzFin}(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\\land\n\\forall w\\in W\\ wRw\\land\n\\forall w,x,y\\in W\\ ((wRx\\land xRy)\\to wRy)\\land\n\\forall w,x\\in W\\ ((wRx\\land xRw)\\to w=x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 12 章，印刷页 155–164；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n有限偏序框架。反对称性禁止不同世界形成反射簇；有限自反传递框架没有这一限制时只刻画 S4。这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 是非严格关系；与 GL 非自反关系通过增删对角线联系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-kripke-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c78d4bf1505bda5c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"9cd755e57aea2c47","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-finite]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}(W)","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GrzFin}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}grz\\text{-}frame}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GrzFin}(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\\land\n\\forall w\\in W\\ wRw\\land\n\\forall w,x,y\\in W\\ ((wRx\\land xRy)\\to wRy)\\land\n\\forall w,x\\in W\\ ((wRx\\land xRw)\\to w=x).","display":true},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":1121,"backlinks":[{"id":"47cb59806fd7ea7e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"exc